description:
Unicorn and little princess.
This download includes images of princesses, adult unicorns and their cubs, castles and carriages, ready-made scenes, rainbow backgrounds and more, hand-drawn watercolor clipart using artificial intelligence.
They’re perfect for creating your own layouts, planners, nursery posters, cards, baby clothes, or any creative project – and look great against any background! In this set of pictures you will receive:
-30 separate PNG files with transparent background;
-13 ready-made scenes in JPG format;
The images average 3000/3000 at their largest size and have a resolution of 300 dpi.
